38898>>>>>>>        Else Begin
38899>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38900>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38901>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38902>>>>>>>        End
